    <defName>RSW_Raxshir</defName>
    <label>raxshir</label>
    <description>Raxshir (also referred to as 'sabertooths') were a large predatory felines with bony cranial crests that were native to the pine forests of the planet Shili. It's striped fur help camouflage it when stalking prey and it was a natural predator to the agile kybuck. Their significance within Togrutan culture has resulted in the export of this creature to many of the worlds in which they themselves have settled.</description>
